// WMI Event Subscription Persistence
// Detects creation of WMI event filters, consumers and bindings, a fileless persistence mechanism that survives reboot and is invisible to autoruns inspection of the usual locations.
// techniques: T1546.003   severity: high   status: stable
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1546.003
//   Register a __EventFilter + CommandLineEventConsumer pair and bind them with a
//   __FilterToConsumerBinding (Sysmon EID 19/20/21).
// source: rules/persistence/wmi-event-subscription.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((EventID =~ "19" or EventID =~ "20" or EventID =~ "21"))
